    <string name="voicepage_control">Control the phone</string>
    <string name="voicepage_control_help">From the assistant, %1$s can read the screen, open apps, tap, type and scroll for you (“open WhatsApp and tell M I\'m running late”). It asks before sending, paying, buying or deleting; it never touches passwords or acts in banking or password apps.</string>
